          <mxGeometry height="42.85714285714286" width="225" x="-210" y="569.9957142857144" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PzCHTrndr9-paPKjK7sf-35" parent="PzCHTrndr9-paPKjK7sf-1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;rounded=0;movable=1;resizable=1;rotatable=1;deletable=1;editable=1;locked=0;connectable=1;" value="&lt;div&gt;Username&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Required (not empty, trimmed of leading/trailing whitespace)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Minimum length (e.g. 3 characters)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Maximum length (e.g. 20–30 characters)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. Allowed characters only: letters, numbers, underscore, hyphen, period (regex like ^[a-zA-Z0-9_.-]+$)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;5. No spaces&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;6. Must start with a letter or number (not a symbol)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;7. No consecutive special characters (e.g. __, ..)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Password&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1. Required (not empty)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;2. Minimum length (e.g. 8–12 characters)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;3. Maximum length cap (e.g. 64–128 characters, just to prevent absurdly long input, not to restrict security)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;4. No character-type restrictions (don’t block special characters or spaces)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="367.15" width="290" x="-230" y="600" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
